C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"print\" url=\"ISic001337.jpg\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n         \u003C/surface>\n     -->\u003C/facsimile>\n    \u003Ctext>\n        \u003Cbody>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" subtype=\"primary\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"grc\" resp=\"#AA\">\n                \u003Cab>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Corig>ΠΟΛ\u003C/orig>\u003Cgap reason=\"illegible\" quantity=\"1\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Corig>ΛΙ\u003C/orig>Β\n                \u003C/ab>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\u003Capp>\u003Cnote>Text of IG after Carrera\u003C/note>\u003C/app>\u003C/listApp>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\">\n                \u003Cp>\u003C!--translation(s) - add @xml:lang for 'en' or 'it' to div-->\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"commentary\" resp=\"#martaf\">\n                \u003Cp>The stone is too fragmentary to allow any firm conclusions regarding its content. Carrera (1639, 290), however, believed that he could identify a reference to the war between the Catanians and the Libyans.\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"bibliography\">\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"edition\">\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"corpus\" n=\"IG\">\n                        \u003Cauthor>Kaibel\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1890\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>\n                            \u003Cref target=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\">517\u003C/ref>\n                        \u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/Q2SBPG9F\"/>\n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl/>\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Carrera\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1639\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>290\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"http://zotero.org/groups/382445/items/JPVJSTWU\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002755\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002755\u003C/ref>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n\t   \u003ClistBibl type=\"discussion\">\u003Cbibl/>\u003C/listBibl>\n            \u003C/div>\n        \u003C/body>\n    \u003C/text>\n\u003C/TEI>\n"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
